      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating",
        "PMC12839976::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A passive film protects a high-entropy alloy from corrosion by limiting material exchange or dissolution.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating",
        "PMC12839976::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The passive oxide film separately provides wear resistance.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A surface pretreatment or alloying additive can enhance passive-film stability.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12565319::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the proposed ambient-to-moderately-elevated-temperature NaCl tribocorrosion conditions, passive-film regeneration is impeded.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passive-film integrity and thickness are the structural variables governing the coupled response.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::013::3_4_tribocorrosion_performance_after_ann",
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating",
        "PMC12839976::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical disruption of the film exposes reactive metal to the corrosive environment.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::013::3_4_tribocorrosion_performance_after_ann",
        "PMC12565319::web::016::3_3_corrosion_behavior_of_hea_coating"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Corrosion feeds back to increase wear through loss of lubricious and protective oxides.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simultaneous wear and corrosion will increase both wear depth and corrosion penetration relative to separate wear-only and corrosion-only baselines.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stabilizing the passive film will reduce both the wear and corrosion components of degradation under coupled testing.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
